<title>CANADA: CHUM to make extra C$0.14/share payouts.</title>
<headline>CHUM to make extra C$0.14/share payouts.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broadcaster CHUM Ltd said on Tuesday it would make an extra dividend payment of C$0.14 a share to holders of both its B non-voting shares and its common shares.</p>
<p>This is in addition to its regularly quarterly dividend of C$0.02 to B shareholders and annual C$0.08 payout to common shareholders.</p>
<p>Payment will be made September 1 to shareholders of record August 15.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
